{"type":"plan","title":"Bánh Chưng Tết: Lời Yêu Thương","logline":"Một chiều Ba Mươi Tết, bé An học gói bánh chưng từ bà, qua đêm canh nồi nghe chuyện xưa, đến sáng Mùng Một đặt chiếc bánh đầu tiên lên bàn thờ tổ tiên.","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Afternoon golden light slants across the tiled courtyard. Bà sits on a low stool, An kneels beside her at the woven mat. The charcoal stove stands behind them, big pot ready. Green banana leaves fan out on the mat. Wide framing shows the narrow tube-house walls rising both sides.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Chiều Ba Mươi Tết, bé An cùng bà gói bánh chưng trong sân nhà ở phố cổ Hà Nội.","cites":[1,5,6]},{"index":2,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Afternoon light, closer on the mat. Bà's hands spread a banana leaf flat, veins catching light. She scoops white rice, then yellow bean paste, then pork cubes into the center. An's small hands hover, watching. Tiles and stool legs frame bottom.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Bà trải lá dong xanh lên mâm, đong gạo nếp trắng, nhân đậu xanh và thịt.","cites":[1,5]},{"index":3,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Afternoon, over An's shoulder. An folds the leaf edges inward, corners meeting crisply. Bà's hand guides the bamboo string around the parcel, pulling tight, tying a neat bow. An's fingers mimic the knot. Shallow depth, leaf texture and string detail sharp.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"An học bà gấp lá thật vuông và buộc lạt tre thật chặt.","cites":[4,5]},{"index":4,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Afternoon, two-shot. An holds up the first finished cake — square, tight, proud. Bà smiles, one hand on An's head. The mat with remaining leaves behind them. Warm light on both faces.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Chiếc bánh đầu tiên An tự gói, bà khen vuông vắn như bánh của người lớn.","cites":[4,5]},{"index":5,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Night, lantern glow from the stove. The big iron pot boils vigorously, steam rising in thick curls. Charcoal glows ruby red beneath. Bà and An sit on stools on either side, silhouettes against the steam. Courtyard walls dark, sky a deep blue slit.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Đêm xuống, nồi bánh sôi lục bục trên bếp lửa hồng giữa sân.","cites":[1,4]},{"index":6,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Night, firelight on faces. Two-shot, slightly low angle. Bà gestures toward the pot as she speaks, An turns head, eyes wide. Steam curls between them. The pot's rim visible lower frame.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Hai bà cháu ngồi canh nồi bánh, bà kể chuyện Lang Liêu dâng bánh cho vua Hùng.","cites":[1,4,5]},{"index":7,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Night, tight on Bà's hand pointing at a cooked cake lifted from the pot — leaves dark olive, steaming. An's face fills the right third, eyes round, mouth slightly open. Gold firelight paints both.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Bà chỉ chiếc bánh vuông như mặt đất, An tròn mắt lắng nghe.","cites":[4,5]},{"index":8,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Midnight, high angle over Hanoi Old Quarter rooftops. Narrow tiled roofs stretch to horizon, dark alleys between. Fireworks explode in cascades — crimson, gold, emerald — reflecting on tile curves. Distant cheers faint. No characters, but the set is a cast member.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Đêm giao thừa, pháo hoa nở rực trên những mái ngói phố cổ.","cites":[3,6]},{"index":9,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Midnight, back in courtyard, low angle. An asleep, head on Bà's lap, one tiny fist still clenched around the bamboo string from the first cake. Bà's hand rests on An's hair. Stove embers dying, faint glow. Tiles cool.","mode":"still","dialogue":"An ngủ gục trên vai bà, tay vẫn nắm sợi lạt tre.","cites":[4,5]},{"index":10,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Dawn, pale lemon light through side doors. An's bare feet patter on dark floor, running from courtyard into front room. Bà follows slower, silhouette in doorway. Altar shelf glows ahead.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Sáng mùng Một, An mở mắt và chạy ra phòng khách.","cites":[2,5]},{"index":11,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Dawn, insert shot on the altar's white floating shelf. The first square cake An made sits centered — leaves glossy olive, string taut. Gold lotus lanterns flank it, warm halos. Incense smoke curls. Framed ancestors watch.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Trên bàn thờ là chiếc bánh chưng vuông vức đầu tiên do chính tay An gói.","cites":[2,4]}]}
